  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until translucent, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and caraway seeds; cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cannellini beans, chicken broth, salt, and black pepper; stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 10-12 minutes, or until the liquid has reduced slightly.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and serve hot."
